version: v1alpha1
metadata:
  name: rocket-patched
  version: "{{ .VERSION }}"
  author: rocket-stack
  description: |
    [{{ .TIER }}] Patched mainline `rocket` DRM-accel kernel module for the
    RK3588 NPU (Turing Pi 2 RK1). Adds the 081 clock lever (rocket_npu_clk_hz
    module param, set from runtime-resume) so the NPU compute clock can be raised
    from the 200 MHz DT default to 600 MHz, plus the 083 IOMMU keep-attached
    dispatch-latency patch. Installs to extra/ so it overrides the stock in-tree
    rocket.ko. Replace the rockchip-rknn extension with this one in your
    schematic; load with machineconfig kernel.modules and
    rocket_npu_clk_hz=<hz>. Requires module.sig_enforce removed at install.
  compatibility:
    talos:
      version: ">= v1.13.0"
